<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
	<meta charset="UTF-8">
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
	<title>Contact Us | The Helper Hospital</title>
	<link rel="stylesheet" href="/styling.css">
</head>
<body>
	<%- include("_header.ejs") %>

	<main class="main-shell">
		<section class="section-header reveal">
			<p class="eyebrow">We are here to help</p>
			<h1>Contact The Helper Hospital</h1>
			<p>Reach our team for appointments, patient guidance, visiting information, or help finding the right hospital service.</p>
		</section>

		<section class="side-by-side reveal">
			<div class="content-panel">
				<p class="eyebrow">Get in touch</p>
				<h2>Talk to our care team</h2>
				<p>Our reception team can direct you to the right department and answer questions about your visit.</p>

				<ul class="meta-list">
					<li><span>Phone</span><strong><a href="tel:0718565456">0718565456</a></strong></li>
					<li><span>Email</span><strong><a href="mailto:care@thehelperhospital.com">care@thehelperhospital.com</a></strong></li>
					<li><span>Emergency care</span><strong>Available 24/7</strong></li>
					<li><span>Reception hours</span><strong>Monday - Sunday, 8am - 6pm</strong></li>
				</ul>
			</div>

			<div class="card-grid">
				<article class="info-card">
					<div class="badge">Visit us</div>
					<h3>Hospital reception</h3>
					<p>The Helper Hospital<br>Level 4 Healthcare Centre<br>Main reception, hospital campus</p>
				</article>
				<article class="info-card">
					<div class="badge">Before you call</div>
					<h3>Have these details ready</h3>
					<p>Patient name, appointment details, and a brief description of how we can assist you.</p>
				</article>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="content-panel contact-booking-panel reveal" aria-labelledby="contact-booking-title">
			<div class="contact-booking-copy">
				<p class="eyebrow">Plan your visit</p>
				<h2 id="contact-booking-title">Ready to book an appointment?</h2>
				<p>Choose a patient, doctor, date, and time on our appointment page. Our hospital team will communicate with you once your appointment details have been processed.</p>
			</div>
			<a class="primary-btn" href="/appointments">Book an appointment</a>
		</section>

		<section class="content-panel reveal">
			<p class="eyebrow">Need immediate assistance?</p>
			<h2>For emergencies, call us now</h2>
			<p>Call <a class="primary-btn" href="tel:0718565456">0718565456</a> for urgent hospital assistance. If you are experiencing a life-threatening emergency, contact your local emergency services.</p>
		</section>
	</main>

	<%- include("_footer.ejs") %>
	<script src="/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
